  "description": "Ancient Greek and Roman accounts of this and other Bactrian rivers are confused. The Barrington Atlas tentatively identifies this ancient river with the modern Ab-e-Safed (Dary\u0101-ye Saf\u0113d) in Afghanistan's Jowzjan province.",
